// Package dictionary: birth and adoption grant (PAJE, wave 1) + base
// allowance and PreParE (wave 3, W3-PFPAJE2).
// The rules of `02-prime.law`, `04-base.law` and `05-prepare.law` derive
// values from the pinned fragments; the case supplies resources, the
// applicable ceilings, the BMAF, the monthly SMIC, civil-record facts (care,
// age cohort, prior activity) and the examination and payment dates
// (provenance — case facts; the BMAF/ceiling series are neighbours
// `fr.pf.core`/`fr.tax.income_for_pf`, the SMIC series is
// `fr.travail.smic`; see boundaries).
//
// DEONTIC MAP OVER PINNED TEXTS ONLY (bytes of 01-sources.law; outside
// them — boundary, not conjecture).
//
//   D1. Duty of the fund to pay. The bytes contain no «l'organisme verse»
//   formula; there is the link «prime attribuée et versée» (L. 531-2,
//   para. 1) + «prime attribuée selon le montant en vigueur» (R. 531-1,
//   para. 6). The duty triggers on prime_attribuee (right + computed amount
//   + examination of the situation). The bearer is unnamed in the texts —
//   the «debtor fund of the case» link is empirical (deontic-migration.md
//   pattern), performance is the empirical fact prime_versee. Window
//   [@2021-01-01, ∞) is the package coverage window.
//   D2. No «ne sont pas dues» exceptions in scope: no defeaters.
//   No duties of the recipient («doit», «est tenu») in the 7 fragments —
//   only conditions for opening the right and requisites (examination of
//   the situation in R. 531-1, declaration of pregnancy from the NOTA of
//   D. 531-2 — an applicability condition of the wording, established by
//   the fund within the examination; see B-PAJE-DECLARATION).
//   No powers of bodies, sanctions, or recovery procedures in scope:
//   cross recovery under L. 553-2 is package fr.prestations.versement
//   (wave 5).
//   Time limits: payment of naissance (L. 531-2, para. 2) and adoption
//   (D. 531-2, II) — the engine does not compute the calendar derivation
//   «dernier jour du mois civil suivant» backwards (§86); the deadline
//   date is an established case fact (B-PAJE-DEADLINE-CALC), the rule
//   records lateness.
//   D1B. Duty of the fund to pay the awarded base allowance. Triggers on
//   base_attribuee (right + computed amount + eligible month). the bearer is
//   the empirical organisme_debiteur (the texts name only «versée»); performance
//   is base_versee. Window [@2021-01-01, ∞).
//   D1P. Duty of the fund to pay the awarded PreParE. Triggers on
//   prepare_attribuee; bearer performance is prepare_versee.
//   Window [@2021-01-01, ∞).
//   D2 (unchanged) + L. 531-4, III, para. 4 «ne peuvent cumuler» (two
//   full-rate PreParE in one couple) and the part-time sum cap/top-up
//   (L. 531-4, III + D. 531-4, last para.): no rules — cumulation needs a
//   sum over co-claimants; boundary B-PAJE2-COUPLE-CUMUL with a scenario
//   pair showing individual amounts still compute.
//   Wave-3 prohibitions/sanctions: none built — overpayment recovery
//   (D. 531-9, III) is cross recovery under L. 553-2 — package
//   fr.prestations.versement (wave 5), boundary B-PAJE2-RECOUVREMENT.
//   D3. Duty of the allocataire to declare the pregnancy within the first
//   14 weeks (D. 532-1, para. 1; both wordings identical for this norm).
//   duty-holder, lowercase-typed m: Menage (household/person — the allocataire);
//   beneficiary — the debtor fund (o) as the modeled party; both statutory
//   destinations and the in-window timing are enforced through the derived
//   performance declaration_grossesse_effectuee (both-destination sending +
//   conforming medical document — FULL RETURN 03, R02-01/02 — plus
//   envoi within [debut, limite] — RETURN04, R03-01: the window check is
//   enforced in the derivation because the achieved head is timeless and
//   would otherwise let a late send satisfy the duty, E-0315), so no
//   generic performed-declaration assertion can satisfy the duty without
//   proof of both addressees and of timely sending. The health-insurance
//   body itself stays unmodeled —
//   boundary B-PAJE2-D532-ASSURANCE-MALADIE (narrowed). The closed window
//   [debut, limite] is declared as data in
//   07-examens-medicaux.deontic-window.toml (RETURN 2026-10-08;
//   `law gen deontic-window --write` pending, GENERATED_OUTPUT_PENDING).
//   Para. 2 (attestation by the prescribed medical document of the first
//   prenatal exam, conforming to the standard model) is the established
//   documentary fact document_medical_conforme, a premise of the derived
//   performance; the external form identity stays established-input
//   provenance — boundary B-PAJE2-D532-FORMULAIRE (narrowed).
//   D4. Suspension of PAJE payment (D. 532-2): the PMI head doctor's power
//   to request (demande_medecin_pmi trigger) + the fund's duty to suspend,
//   expressed as the literal head suspension_versement_paje (no separate
//   duty head — performance coincides with the institutional effect; same
//   rationale as fr.pf.cmg N1/N2 and fr.casf.rsa sanction_suspension).
//   «En l'absence de motifs légitimes» is an affirmative established fact
//   sans_motif_legitime_examens (RETURN 2026-10-08: missing evidence must
//   not prove absence; the RSA not_known precedent is not followed here).
//   motif_legitime_examens (positive) and sans_motif_legitime_examens
//   (affirmative absence) are mutually exclusive fund inputs; neither
//   established means unevaluated — no suspension. The income-pf
//   §47.3-judgment proposal was decided the other way (the text names no
//   evaluating organ; journal records the proposal). The effect on the
//   D1/D1B/D1P payment duties is fund/versement-stage applied, not
//   a defeater — boundary B-PAJE2-D532-EFFET with a scenario pair.
//   D5. DOM scope and non-cumulation (L. 755-19, FINISH D73). Para. 1
//   («est attribuée dans les collectivités mentionnées à l'article
//   L. 751-1 dans les conditions définies au titre III du livre V») is
//   an applicability status: the Book V Title III conditions are exactly
//   what this package formalizes, so no new duty — the existing D1/D1B/
//   D1P payment duties trigger on the awards unchanged. Para. 2
//   («n'est pas cumulable avec les allocations familiales et leurs
//   majorations pour âge servies au titre d'un seul enfant à charge»)
//   and para. 3 («ne sont pas cumulables avec le complément familial
//   défini à l'article L. 755-16») are prohibitions with literal heads
//   (phase-1 criterion: the barred combination is only a premise for
//   the versement-stage exclusion — same rationale as fr.pf.cmg N1/N2;
//   no fulfillment-by-date, violation, sanction or registry consumer
//   calls for a norm-conclusion now). The AF single-child award and the
//   L. 755-16 CF award are established fund-side facts (substance owned
//   by fr.pf.af / fr.pf.cf — no duplicate rules here). No recipient
//   duties, powers, sanctions or deadlines in L. 755-19.
//
// LAYER BOUNDARIES (omission records, not norms):
// B-PAJE-BMAF: BMAF series (L. 551-1) — neighbour fr.pf.core; in the case — bmaf fact.
// B-PAJE-PLAFOND: ceiling of the full-rate base allowance (CF, L. 522-1,
// wave 3) and N-2 resources (R. 532-1/R. 532-3, fr.tax.income_for_pf); in the
// case — facts; the rule builds the 119.47% ratio (D. 531-3-1 is its own anchor).
// R. 531-1, para. 3 revalues «les plafonds annuels respectifs» on 1 January
// each year, each from its own previous value (opposable DSS instruction
// DSS/2B/2024/181: «ces différents plafonds … sont revalorisés de 4,8 %»):
// the published 2025 grant ceiling (table 3.1: 1 child, lone parent —
// 48 186 €) is not 119.47% of the published full-rate ceiling (table 3.2:
// 40 330 € → 48 182.25 €). A case that establishes the revalued grant
// ceiling (plafond_prime_revalorise) gets it as plafond_prime directly
// (rule PlafondPrimeRevalorise); the 119.47% construction stays for cases
// that establish only the full-rate ceiling. The two inputs are exclusive
// in one case: both would key-conflict on plafond_prime (§45.1). Found by
// the OpenFisca-France 176.1.2 transfer (analysis/openfisca-176).
// B-PAJE-DATE-DECRET: «date fixée par décret» (L. 531-2, para. 2: 1°/2° and
// adoption) — decree dates not pinned; the right is derived, the exact
// award date is not.
// B-PAJE-DEADLINE-CALC: derivation of the deadline date from «dernier jour
// du mois civil suivant le sixième mois» / «deuxième mois qui suit
// l'arrivée» — date_limite fact established by the fund.
// B-PAJE-TRANSITOIRE-2021: NOTA of L. 531-2 III — April 2021 payment for
// 06–09.2020 pregnancies — paid out; no rule built.
// B-PAJE-DECLARATION: NOTA of D. 531-2 — old provisions of II.1 for
// pregnancies declared from 01.01.2015; declaration established by the fund.
// B-PAJE-AGE-ADOPTION: age limits (L. 531-1/D. 531-1/L. 512-3 2°) and
// reception conditions of L. 512-4 — condition_age_adoption fact
// (thresholds — pf.core).
// B-PAJE-ALLOCATION-BASE: built in wave 3 (04-base.law); the ceiling
// reference from D. 531-3-1 stays shared (base partiel uses plafond_prime).
//
// WAVE-3 BOUNDARIES (omission records, not norms):
// B-PAJE2-PLAFOND-PLEIN: the full-rate ceiling is the CF ceiling (L. 531-3,
// current para. 2 → L. 522-1; old para. 1 → decree) — package fr.pf.cf,
// not yet formalized; in the case — the plafond_base_taux_plein fact.
// B-PAJE2-SMIC: monthly SMIC (= hourly SMIC × 169) — series fr.travail.smic;
// in the case — the smic_mensuel fact (the ×169 step is fund-side).
// B-PAJE2-PERIODE: monthly entitlement (mois_eligible_*) and period ends are
// fund-established (calendar derivation, same class as B-PAJE-DEADLINE-CALC).
// B-PAJE2-DUREE-CALC: month counts (D. 531-13/14/14-1/16/16-1, L. 531-4
// I.3/IV/V/VI, R. 531-4 six-month lock, D. 531-16 two-month extension) need
// month arithmetic; duration articles are pinned, no computational rules.
// B-PAJE2-ETAT-CIVIL: care, age cohort, prior activity + assimilation
// (R. 531-2/D. 531-15: 2/4/5-year references, 8 quarters), quotité
// attestations and elected-official thresholds are fund-established from
// civil, retirement and tax records (condition_age_base, cohorte_enfant,
// activite_anterieure_suffisante, condition_age_prepare, attestation_quotite,
// condition_elu) — same class as B-PAJE-AGE-ADOPTION.
// B-PAJE2-COUPLE-CUMUL: couple-wide non-cumul of two full PreParE and the
// part-time sum cap/top-up (L. 531-4, III; D. 531-4, last para.) — no rules.
// B-PAJE2-VI-CUMUL-REVENU: L. 531-4, VI, para. 1 (full benefit cumulated with
// professional income under decree conditions) — decree unpinned, no rule.
// B-PAJE2-PROLONGATION: L. 531-4, I.3, paras. 2–4 (shared-claim extension,
// single-parent extension, September school-place extension) — duration
// mechanics fund-side (B-PAJE2-DUREE-CALC).
// B-PAJE2-CONVENTION: L. 531-4-1 (return-to-work agreement procedure) —
// pinned (both wordings), no rules: procedure, not a computable norm.
// B-PAJE2-CMG-VOISIN: D. 531-24, R. 531-5, R. 531-6 read L. 531-5 (CMG) —
// not pinned; package fr.pf.cmg.
// B-PAJE2-D531-12: no current version in the registry — nothing to pin.
// B-PAJE2-OWNERSHIP: R. 531-2/3/4, D. 531-14-1, D. 531-16-1, L. 531-1 and
// L. 531-4-1 are PENDING_WAVE in INVENTORY (no owner) — pinned here as
// PreParE substance; reassignment to CNAF-PFPAJE proposed to the coordinator.
// B-PAJE2-RECOUVREMENT: D. 531-9, III (recovery of overpaid part-time
// benefit) — cross recovery, package fr.prestations.versement (wave 5).
// B-PAJE2-DSS: no DSS instructions available — amounts are built from the
// text (DECISION-0452); the published-value cross-check stays DSS_PENDING.
// B-PAJE2-OPENFISCA: every OpenFisca base/PreParE case runs in 2013–2018
// (outside the [2021-01-01, ∞) window) and paje_prepare is a TODO stub in
// their code — OUT_OF_COVERAGE, recorded in tools/foreign-map.json.
// B-PAJE2-D531-1-FIX: wave-1 pinned D. 531-1 (and would have pinned R. 531-3)
// EMPTY — the fetch walk read only `<p>`; fixed in wave 3 (see 01-sources.law).
// The six non-empty wave-1 documents rebuild byte-identical.
// B-PAJE2-MAJORE-DOUBLE: under the VI increased-amount option the plain full
// amount (96.62%) still concludes as montant_prepare_plein (intermediate) but
// only the increased amount (157.93%) is awarded — PreparePleinAttribue carries
// `not_known(option_majoree)`, otherwise both awards conclude and §45.1
// key-conflicts on prepare_attribuee. Scenario prepare-majore pins the
// 631.72 € award.
//
// FINISH D72 BOUNDARIES (omission records, not norms):
// B-PAJE2-D532-ASSURANCE-MALADIE (FULL RETURN 03, narrowed): the
// health-insurance body as a party belongs to another branch and stays
// unmodeled (no second beneficiary party); its destination is enforced —
// the derived performance requires the both-destination sending fact, so
// fulfillment without proof of this addressee cannot conclude.
// B-PAJE2-D532-FORMULAIRE (FULL RETURN 03, narrowed): the prescribed-model
// conformity (ministerial arrêté before 2023, formulaire homologué since)
// is the established documentary fact document_medical_conforme, a premise
// of the derived performance; the external form identity and content stay
// established-input provenance (unpinned ministerial instrument).
// B-PAJE2-D532-L5331-PLURIEL: D. 532-2 reads «les examens» while the pinned
// L. 533-1 (package fr.pf.core) names the first prenatal exam; the reading
// is upstream — here an established input (examens_l5331_non_passes).
// B-PAJE2-D532-MOIS-EFFET: the «mois civil qui suit» derivation is
// fund-established (same class as B-PAJE-DEADLINE-CALC).
// B-PAJE2-D532-EFFET: suspension is not wired as a defeater into the D1/
// D1B/D1P payment duties (strict rules; §149); the fund applies the effect
// at the versement stage. Scenario suspension-avec-prime shows the award
// still computing while the suspension concludes.
// B-PAJE2-D532-VIOLATION (RETURN04): VIOLATED needs explicit
// non-performance (§136.3: established `not effectuee` or a completeness
// certificate over timely conforming sending); the fund establishes it —
// here only ACTIVE / SATISFIED / UNDETERMINED positions are shown.
// B-PAJE2-D532-OWNERSHIP: D. 532-1/D. 532-2 are PENDING_WAVE in INVENTORY
// (no owner) — pinned here as PAJE substance per the D72 transfer from the
// income-pf line; reassignment to CNAF-PFPAJE proposed to the coordinator.
//
// FINISH D73 BOUNDARIES (omission records, not norms):
// B-PAJE2-DOM-L751-1 (FULL RETURN 03, modelled 6/6): the L. 751-1 list is
// read for the Territoire reading, not pinned here (context owned by the
// DOM line, D-76: LEGIARTI000031323778, 2015-10-16→2028-01-01 — «en
// Guadeloupe, en Guyane, en Martinique, à La Réunion, à Saint-Barthélemy
// et à Saint-Martin»); all six collectivities are now Territoire members.
// Mayotte is correctly out (not in the L. 751-1 list; wave 7), AUTRE out.
// B-PAJE2-DOM-AF-UNIQUE: single-child AF with age supplements (L. 755-11/12,
// D. 755-5 substance) is owned by fr.pf.af; here the established input
// af_enfant_unique_servies. A future liaison on the fr.pf.af award is a
// request, not an edit.
// B-PAJE2-DOM-CF: the L. 755-16 complément familial is owned by fr.pf.cf
// (D73 transfer); here the established input cf_dom_l755_16_servi. A
// future liaison on the fr.pf.cf DOM award is a request, not an edit.
// B-PAJE2-DOM-EFFET: the cumulation bars are literal heads; the payment
// exclusion applies at the versement stage (same rationale as
// B-CMG-L531-9-PREPARE and B-PAJE2-D532-EFFET), not as a defeater into
// the D1B/D1P payment duties (strict rules; §149).
// B-PAJE2-DOM-OWNERSHIP: L. 755-19 is PENDING_WAVE in INVENTORY
// (no owner) — pinned here as PAJE substance per the D73 transfer from the
// dom line; reassignment to CNAF-PFPAJE proposed to the coordinator.
//
// Scenarios: tests/prime-naissance-*.lawtest, tests/prime-adoption-*.lawtest
// (families fr.pf.paje#prime-naissance / #prime-adoption in law.toml):
// inputs→value; boundary pairs (ceiling ±1 €, wordings D. 531-2 03/04.2021,
// R. 531-1 10.2022, décès/terme, retard); tests/devoir-versement-*.lawtest
// (positions: ACTIVE / no right / threshold).
// Wave 3: tests/base-*.lawtest (family fr.pf.paje#allocation-base):
// inputs→value; ceiling pairs (full = / ±1 €, partiel = / over);
// cohort regime pairs (pre-2018 child at 02.2021 old rate / 05.2021 new
// rate); adoption; sans-mois; tests/prepare-*.lawtest (family
// fr.pf.paje#prepare): full/part-time bands, SMIC caps pass/fail, garde and
// forfait-jours ratios, majoré, élus, sans-prior-activity, D. 531-15
// 06/07.2026 wording pair; tests/devoir-base-*.lawtest and
// tests/devoir-prepare-*.lawtest (positions ACTIVE / no right).
// FINISH D72: tests/declaration-*.lawtest, tests/devoir-declarer-*.lawtest
// and tests/suspension-*.lawtest (family fr.pf.paje#examens-medicaux):
// inputs→status; boundaries (sending on the deadline day; pre-start send
// is neither on-time nor late — RETURN 2026-10-08); wording pair
// (2022 predecessor / 2025 current); positions ACTIVE / SATISFIED timely /
// UNDETERMINED late / no pregnancy; derived performance (both-destination
// sending + conforming document + in-window timing; missing input or
// out-of-window send stays silent — FULL RETURN 03 + RETURN04 R03-01);
// suspension granted (affirmative absence) / barred by legitimate reasons /
// unevaluated when neither motive nor absence established / no request /
// exams taken; award+suspension interaction pair.
// FINISH D73: tests/dom-*.lawtest (family fr.pf.paje#dom-paje):
// scope applicable / metro / outside the package window; al. 2 bars
// (plein / partiel / no single-child AF); al. 3 bars (plein / partiel /
// plein PreParE / part-time PreParE / no CF); out-of-DOM pair with both
// benefits open; Saint-Barthélemy / Saint-Martin applicable pair plus a
// Saint-Barthélemy no-AF bar control (FULL RETURN 03).

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.pf.paje version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:pf-paje";

pub entity Menage {
    label fr official "ménage ou personne (L. 531-2 : prime attribuée et versée au ménage ou à la personne)";
    label en unofficial "household or person (L. 531-2: the grant is awarded and paid to the household or the person)";
}

pub entity Enfant {
    label fr official "enfant à naître ou enfant adopté ou accueilli en vue d'adoption (L. 531-2)";
    label en unofficial "child: expected, adopted, or taken in with a view to adoption (L. 531-2)";
}

pub entity Organisme {
    label fr official "organisme débiteur des prestations familiales chargé du dossier";
    label en unofficial "body owing family benefits and handling the case";
}

pub relation ressources_annuelles(m: Menage, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "ressources annuelles du ménage ou de la personne, appréciées dans les conditions de l'article R. 532-1 (fait du dossier; série N-2 — fr.tax.income_for_pf)";
    label en unofficial "annual resources of the household or person under the conditions of Art. R. 532-1 (case fact; N-2 series — fr.tax.income_for_pf)";
}

pub relation plafond_base_taux_plein(m: Menage, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "plafond de l'allocation de base versée à taux plein, référence du plafond prime (L. 522-1, vague 3; fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "ceiling of the full-rate base allowance — basis of the grant ceiling (L. 522-1, wave 3; case fact)";
}

pub relation plafond_prime(m: Menage, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(m);
    label fr official "plafond de ressources de la prime, construit à 119,47 % du plafond base taux plein (D. 531-3-1)";
    label en unofficial "grant resources ceiling, built as 119.47% of the full-rate base ceiling (D. 531-3-1)";
}

pub relation plafond_prime_revalorise(m: Menage, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "plafond de ressources de la prime revalorisé au 1er janvier pour le ménage (R. 531-1, al. 3; série — tableau 3.1 de l'instruction DSS; fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "grant resources ceiling as revalued on 1 January for the household (R. 531-1, para. 3; series — table 3.1 of the DSS instruction; case fact)";
}

pub relation bmaf_applicable(m: Menage, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m);
    label fr official "base mensuelle en vigueur à la date d'examen de la situation (L. 551-1; série — fr.pf.core; fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "BMAF in force on the date the situation is examined (L. 551-1; series — fr.pf.core; case fact)";
}

pub relation attente_naissance(m: Menage, e: Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "grossesse en cours, enfant à naître avant la naissance (L. 531-2, al. 1)";
    label en unofficial "pregnancy in progress, child not yet born (L. 531-2, para. 1)";
}

pub relation naissance_avant_terme_prevu(e: Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "naissance intervenue avant le sixième mois prévu de la grossesse (L. 531-2, al. 2, 1°)";
    label en unofficial "birth before the sixth expected month of pregnancy (L. 531-2, para. 2, 1°)";
}

pub relation deces_apres_20_semaines(e: Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "décès de l'enfant au delà de la vingtième semaine de grossesse (L. 531-2, al. 2, 2°)";
    label en unofficial "death of the child after the 20th week of pregnancy (L. 531-2, para. 2, 2°)";
}

pub relation adoption_arrivee(m: Menage, e: Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "arrivée de l'enfant adopté ou accueilli en vue d'adoption au foyer, dans les conditions de l'article L. 512-4 (fait établi)";
    label en unofficial "arrival of the adopted or taken-in child in the household under the conditions of Art. L. 512-4 (established fact)";
}

pub relation condition_age_adoption(e: Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "condition d'âge adoption remplie, limites L. 531-1 et L. 512-3 2° comprises (seuils — fr.pf.core; fait établi)";
    label en unofficial "adoption age condition met, including the limits of L. 531-1 and L. 512-3 2° (thresholds — fr.pf.core; established fact)";
}

pub relation date_examen_situation(m: Menage, e: Enfant, date: Date) kind empirical {
    label fr official "date d'examen de la situation de la famille (R. 531-1: premier jour du mois civil suivant le cinquième mois / mois de l'arrivée)";
    label en unofficial "date the family situation is examined (R. 531-1: first day of the month after the fifth month / month of arrival)";
}

pub relation droit_prime_naissance(m: Menage, e: Enfant) kind institutional {
    label fr official "droit à la prime à la naissance ouvert (L. 531-2)";
    label en unofficial "right to the birth grant is open (L. 531-2)";
}

pub relation droit_prime_adoption(m: Menage, e: Enfant) kind institutional {
    label fr official "droit à la prime à l'adoption ouvert (L. 531-2)";
    label en unofficial "right to the adoption grant is open (L. 531-2)";
}

pub enum RegimeVersement {
    label fr official "régime temporel du versement de la prime à la naissance";
    label en unofficial "timing regime for payment of the birth grant";
    APRES_NAISSANCE, AVANT_NAISSANCE
}

pub relation regime_versement_naissance(m: Menage, e: Enfant, regime: RegimeVersement) kind institutional {
    label fr official "régime applicable: après la naissance (D. 531-2 éd. 2015) ou avant la naissance dès le 7e mois (L. 531-2 éd. 2020)";
    label en unofficial "applicable regime: after birth (D. 531-2, 2015 wording) or before birth from the 7th month (L. 531-2, 2020 wording)";
}

pub relation montant_prime_naissance(m: Menage, e: Enfant, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(m, e);
    label fr official "montant de la prime à la naissance: 229,75 % de la BMAF (D. 531-2, I)";
    label en unofficial "birth grant amount: 229.75% of the BMAF (D. 531-2, I)";
}

pub relation montant_prime_adoption(m: Menage, e: Enfant, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(m, e);
    label fr official "montant de la prime à l'adoption: 459,5 % de la BMAF, majoration adoption comprise (D. 531-2, I)";
    label en unofficial "adoption grant amount: 459.5% of the BMAF, including the adoption supplement (D. 531-2, I)";
}

pub relation prime_attribuee(m: Menage, e: Enfant, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(m, e);
    label fr official "prime attribuée selon le montant en vigueur à la date d'examen (R. 531-1)";
    label en unofficial "grant awarded at the amount in force on the examination date (R. 531-1)";
}

pub relation montant_primes_adoption_menage(m: Menage, total: Money) kind institutional {
    key(m);
    label fr official "total des primes à l'adoption attribuées au ménage, une prime pour chaque enfant adopté (L. 531-2, al. 1)";
    label en unofficial "total of the adoption grants awarded to the household, one grant per adopted child (L. 531-2, para. 1)";
}

pub relation organisme_debiteur(o: Organisme, m: Menage) kind empirical {
    label fr official "l'organisme est débiteur de la prime du ménage (fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "body owing the household's grant (case fact)";
}

pub relation prime_versee(m: Menage, e: Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(m, e);
    label fr official "la prime a été versée au ménage (exécution)";
    label en unofficial "grant paid to the household (performance)";
}

pub relation date_versement_prime(m: Menage, e: Enfant, date: Date) kind empirical {
    label fr official "date du versement de la prime (fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "date the grant was paid (case fact)";
}

pub relation date_limite_versement(m: Menage, e: Enfant, date: Date) kind empirical {
    label fr official "date limite de versement établie par la caisse (dérivation calendaire — fait établi)";
    label en unofficial "payment deadline set by the fund (calendar derivation — established fact)";
}

pub relation versement_tardif(m: Menage, e: Enfant) kind institutional {
    label fr official "versement après la date limite (L. 531-2, al. 2 ; D. 531-2, II)";
    label en unofficial "payment after the deadline (L. 531-2, para. 2; D. 531-2, II)";
}

// --- Wave 3: base allowance (04-base.law) --------------------------------

pub relation enfant_en_charge(m: Menage, e: Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "enfant à la charge du ménage, né ou arrivé au foyer par adoption ou accueil (L. 531-3, al. 1 et 3 ; fait établi)";
    label en unofficial "child in the household's care, born or arrived through adoption or taking-in (L. 531-3, paras. 1 and 3; established fact)";
}

pub relation condition_age_base(e: Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "condition d'âge base remplie : moins de trois ans (D. 531-1) ou limites L. 531-1/L. 512-3 2° pour l'adopté (L. 531-3, al. 3 ; fait établi)";
    label en unofficial "base age condition met: under three (D. 531-1), or the L. 531-1/L. 512-3 2° limits for an adopted child (L. 531-3, para. 3; established fact)";
}

